{
  "id": "printed-paper-bags",
  "slug": "printed-paper-bags",
  "title": "Custom printed paper bags",
  "category": "paper-bags",
  "status": "published",
  "short_description": "Your bag, carried through town. Kraft and white paper bags printed with your logo — handled carriers and grab bags, in one to four colours.",
  "description": "A printed bag keeps working after the sale: it walks down the high street, sits on the office desk and gets reused. Choose the bag style, the number of print colours, one or two printed sides and the paper, then make it yours.\n\nRunning a bakery? See our [printed bread, baguette and pastry bags](/bakery-packaging/bakery-bags/). Seal smaller bags with [logo stickers](/catering-supplies/logo-stickers/).\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "1 to 4 colour print",
    "Single or double-sided",
    "Kraft or white paper"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen bag, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which bag style should I choose?",
      "a": "Twisted-handle takeaway bags suit hot food and meal orders. Flat-handle carriers are the classic retail and bakery bag; the wide-gusset twisted-handle carrier takes larger or boxed items. SOS grab bags have no handles and suit pastries, sandwiches and counter service. If you are unsure, tell us what goes in the bag and we will advise."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you print other bag sizes?",
      "a": "Yes — small and large versions of most styles are available. Use “Request a custom quantity”, tell us the size you need, and we will quote it."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my bags arrive?",
      "a": "As a general guide, allow several weeks from artwork approval to delivery. We will confirm current timing with your quote."
    }
  ],
